{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","锐锋绝杀"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","击晕目标格各方向直线上的所有敌人并造成伤害，结束后释放英勇冲锋。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","爱丝特瑞达选择一个地图格，从三个方向朝目标格沿直线路径贯穿战场向其冲锋。前两次冲锋过程中对路径上的敌人造成220% + 30% ATK的伤害并使其眩晕2秒，最后一次冲锋从敌方阵营边界冲向我方阵营边界，对路径上的敌人造成330% + 45% ATK伤害并使其眩晕3秒。爱丝特瑞达在冲锋过程中处于无敌状态。\n技能结束后，爱丝特瑞达会跳向沿轴线方向敌人数量最多的我方阵营边界格，再次释放英勇冲锋。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":57,"end":63,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":113,"end":119,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":23,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"keyword:standardline"},{"start":53,"end":67,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":87,"end":91,"tooltip_key":"keyword:sideborderline"},{"start":95,"end":99,"tooltip_key":"keyword:sideborderline"},{"start":109,"end":123,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":146,"end":148,"tooltip_key":"keyword:invincible"},{"start":180,"end":184,"tooltip_key":"keyword:sideborderline"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","前两次冲锋造成的伤害提升至240% + 30% ATK，最后一次冲锋造成的伤害提升至360% + 45% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":46,"end":52,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":42,"end":56,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","前两次冲锋造成的伤害提升至260% + 30% ATK，最后一次冲锋造成的伤害提升至390% + 45% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":46,"end":52,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":42,"end":56,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","前两次冲锋造成的伤害提升至280% + 30% ATK，最后一次冲锋造成的伤害提升至420% + 45% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":46,"end":52,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":42,"end":56,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","前两次冲锋造成的伤害提升至300% + 30% ATK，最后一次冲锋造成的伤害提升至450% + 45% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":46,"end":52,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":42,"end":56,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","冲锋陷阵"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时冲向敌方阵营，击退并挑飞路径上的敌人并造成伤害，主动释放时对周围的敌人造成范围伤害。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，爱丝特瑞达会使用“英勇冲锋”：短暂蓄力后快速向前冲锋至敌方阵营边界，冲锋过程中对路径上的敌人造成240% + 30% ATK伤害，同时将沿途的敌人沿冲锋方向击退，直到途径其他敌人时切换击退目标，直到战场边界。被击退至战场边界的敌人会被挑飞，额外受到320% + 32% ATK伤害并被倒地3秒。爱丝特瑞达在“英勇冲锋”过程中处于霸体状态。\n主动使用时，爱丝特瑞达使用骑枪横扫敌人，对周围一格的敌人造成240% + 30% ATK伤害。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":58,"end":64,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":134,"end":140,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":210,"end":216,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":35,"end":39,"tooltip_key":"keyword:sideborderline"},{"start":54,"end":68,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":130,"end":144,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":170,"end":172,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"},{"start":206,"end":220,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","“英勇冲锋”对路径上的敌人造成的伤害提升至260% + 30% ATK，骑枪横扫造成的伤害提升至260% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":25,"end":31,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":52,"end":58,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":21,"end":35,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":48,"end":62,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","“英勇冲锋”对路径上的敌人造成的伤害提升至280% + 30% ATK，骑枪横扫造成的伤害提升至280% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":25,"end":31,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":52,"end":58,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":21,"end":35,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":48,"end":62,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","“英勇冲锋”对路径上的敌人造成的伤害提升至300% + 30% ATK，骑枪横扫造成的伤害提升至300% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":25,"end":31,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":52,"end":58,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":21,"end":35,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":48,"end":62,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","骑枪绝技"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","对敌人造成多段伤害，并降低其攻击力。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","爱丝特瑞达用骑枪发动迅捷连击，对目标敌人造成7段45% + 6% ATK伤害并使其降低30% + 3%攻击力，持续12秒，若自身处于敌方阵营边界，则每段攻击额外造成20% + 2% ATK伤害。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":27,"end":32,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":46,"end":51,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":85,"end":90,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":24,"end":36,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":68,"end":72,"tooltip_key":"keyword:sideborderline"},{"start":82,"end":94,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","每段连击造成的伤害提升至50% + 6% ATK，敌人的攻击力降低比例提升至30% + 3%。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":20,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":41,"end":46,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","每段连击造成的伤害提升至55% + 6% ATK，敌人的攻击力降低比例提升至30% + 3%。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":20,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":41,"end":46,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","每段连击造成的伤害提升至60% + 6% ATK，敌人的攻击力降低比例提升至30% + 3%。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":20,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":41,"end":46,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身攻击力。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击力提升12%。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击力提升16%。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击力提升20%。"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","荣光战旗"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","插下战旗使附近的友军提升攻击力，降低所受到的伤害。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","当爱丝特瑞达通过“英勇冲锋”抵达敌方阵营边界时，在原地插下半径2格的荣光战旗持续15秒，在战旗范围内的友军提升相当于爱丝特瑞达25%的初始攻击力的攻击力，并且受到的伤害降低20%。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"keyword:sideborderline"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","处于荣光战旗范围内的友军的攻击力提升比例提高至30%，受到的伤害降低比例提升至25%。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","当“英勇冲锋”成功击退敌人到敌方阵营边界时，爱丝特瑞达会标记目标敌人，使其在15秒内受到的伤害提升25%。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"keyword:sideborderline"}]],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","处于荣光战旗范围内的友军的攻击力提升比例提高至35%，受到的伤害降低比例提升至30%。"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","锐锋绝杀结束后回复生命和护盾，英勇冲锋结束后提升攻击力和穿透。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","爱丝特瑞达释放“锐锋绝杀”结束后回复300% ATK生命，同时获得300% ATK护盾；释放“英勇冲锋”结束后提高25点穿透和20%攻击力，持续15秒。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":33,"end":41,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","英毅骑枪"]]}